{
	"$schema": "http://127.0.0.1:5186/schema/registry-item.json",
	"name": "skeleton",
	"title": "Skeleton 骨架屏",
	"type": "registry:ui",
	"description": "内容加载时按最终布局显示的占位。",
	"meta": {
		"valar": {
			"keywords": [
				"骨架屏",
				"skeleton",
				"加载占位",
				"loading",
				"占位"
			],
			"whenToUse": [
				"内容加载时按最终布局显示占位，减少布局跳动"
			],
			"whenNotToUse": [
				{
					"case": "按钮或小区域的短暂加载",
					"use": "spinner"
				},
				{
					"case": "可度量的进度",
					"use": "progress"
				},
				{
					"case": "加载完但没有数据",
					"use": "empty"
				}
			],
			"accessibility": [
				"占位是装饰，在容器上用 aria-busy 或提供读屏可读的加载文字"
			],
			"responsive": [
				"占位尺寸与真实内容一致，各断点都要对应"
			],
			"related": [
				"spinner",
				"progress",
				"empty"
			]
		}
	},
	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Skeleton 设计规范\n\n- 用于加载时占位，形状和尺寸尽量与真实内容一致（文字行、头像、卡片），避免加载完成后布局跳动。\n- 头像占位保留直径；同一行的文字占位随容器收缩，保留头像和文字之间的间距。\n- 加载很快（几百毫秒内）时不要显示骨架屏；加载失败时替换为错误提示，不要一直显示 Skeleton。\n- Skeleton 对读屏器没有意义：给加载中的容器设 `aria-busy=\"true\"`，需要时另外放一段 `sr-only` 的“正在加载”文字。\n- 颜色和动画跟随组件样式，不要另设背景色。\n- 筛选条件生成期间用 `appearance=\"filter\"`。占位高 24 px、圆角 8 px、间距 8 px，宽度由最终条件和可用空间决定。用 `delay` 指定毫秒级错峰。默认保留 1.2 秒入场和 2 秒循环，开启减少动态效果时立即显示静态占位。完成后在原位替换为条件，保留现有列表，并通过独立状态文字播报。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "skeleton/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "import Root from \"./skeleton.svelte\";\n\nexport {\n\tRoot,\n\t//\n\tRoot as Skeleton,\n};\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "skeleton/index.ts"
		},
		{
			"content": "<svelte:options css=\"injected\" />\n\n<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef, type WithoutChildren } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tappearance = \"default\",\n\t\tdelay = 0,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithoutChildren<WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>>> & {\n\t\tappearance?: \"default\" | \"filter\";\n\t\t/** Delay in milliseconds before a filter placeholder appears. */\n\t\tdelay?: number;\n\t} = $props();\n</script>\n\n<div\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"skeleton\"\n\tdata-appearance={appearance}\n\taria-hidden={appearance === \"filter\" ? true : undefined}\n\tstyle:--valar-skeleton-delay={appearance === \"filter\" ? `${delay}ms` : undefined}\n\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\"max-w-full\",\n\t\tappearance === \"filter\"\n\t\t\t? \"h-6 rounded-[8px] border-0 bg-[lch(92.44%_.5_282)] dark:bg-[lch(7.32%_.85_272)]\"\n\t\t\t: \"bg-muted rounded-md motion-safe:animate-pulse\",\n\t\tclassName\n\t)}\n\t{...restProps}\n></div>\n\n<style>\n\t@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) {\n\t\t[data-appearance=\"filter\"] {\n\t\t\tanimation:\n\t\t\t\tfilter-entry 1.2s ease var(--valar-skeleton-delay) both,\n\t\t\t\tfilter-loop 2s ease calc(1.2s + var(--valar-skeleton-delay)) infinite;\n\t\t}\n\t}\n\n\t@keyframes filter-entry {\n\t\t0% { opacity: 0; }\n\t\t50% { opacity: 1; }\n\t\t100% { opacity: 0.3; }\n\t}\n\n\t@keyframes filter-loop {\n\t\t0%, 20%, 100% { opacity: 0.3; }\n\t\t60% { opacity: 1; }\n\t}\n</style>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "skeleton/skeleton.svelte"
		}
	]
}